  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance to Refugees and Asylum Seekers in Viet Nam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This UN-to-UN partnership between IOM and UNHCR is to ensure uninterrupted food and basic services provision to the 151 Sri Lankan migrants during the asylum seeker registration and refugee status review process. Services to be provided include: (1) provision of food and beverage; (2) medical assistance; and (3) facilities maintenance for water, sanitation and hygiene.</narrative>
  </description>
